#. Description of the plugin
msgid ""
"TrackShip for WooCommerce integrates TrackShip into your WooCommerce Store "
"and auto-tracks your orders, automates your post-shipping workflow and "
"allows you to provide a superior Post-Purchase experience to your customers."
msgstr ""
"TrackShip voor WooCommerce integreert TrackShip in uw WooCommerce Store en "
"volgt automatisch uw bestellingen, automatiseert uw workflow na verzending "
"en stelt u in staat om uw klanten een superieure post-aankoopervaring te "
"bieden."

#: trackship-for-woocommerce.php:136
msgid "TrackShip for WooCommerce requires a Shipment Tracking extension."
msgstr "TrackShip for WooCommerce vereist een extensie voor zendingtracking."

#: includes/views/setup.php:29
msgid ""
"TrackShip is syncing fulfillment-based shipments automatically. All new "
"fulfillments will be tracked in real time."
msgstr ""
"TrackShip synchroniseert fulfillment-gebaseerde zendingen automatisch. Alle "
"nieuwe fulfillments worden in realtime gevolgd."

